fix(admin): reskin admin panel to design-system tokens + fix material upload + a11y + JSON-LD

Comprehensive admin panel + site consistency repair (independent review follow-up):

- ADMIN RESKIN: rewrite admin.html inline <style> to design-system tokens
  (--panel/--line/--ink1/--muted/--mint/--violet). Removes legacy light-gray
  .admin-btn-secondary (#e9ecef, 1.06:1 contrast fail -> dark glass), white .tab
  pills (-> violet/mint gradient active), and undefined var(--sage)/var(--text-muted).
  role badges, alerts, inputs, member/application cards now match the #060612
  violet/mint system.

- FIX MATERIAL UPLOAD (P1): api() helper forced Content-Type: application/json
  on FormData bodies, breaking multipart boundary -> backend request.files empty.
  Now lets browser set multipart CT for FormData. Slide/Quiz/File uploads work again.

- FIX MALFORMED JSON-LD (P1): consolidation had triplicated
  'type="application/ld+json"> type="..." type="..."' opening tags on 9 pages.
  Collapsed to single clean tag; all JSON-LD now parses as valid JSON.

- A11Y CONTRAST: --faint #5d5889 (3.09:1) -> #7f79b3 (5.07:1) passes WCAG AA;
  .btn-primary/.admin-btn-primary white-on-violet (3.86:1) -> dark #08060f
  (5.2-6.3:1). Success/danger buttons re-skinned to coherent mint/coral glass.

Verified: all pages 200, 1 stylesheet each, 0 JS errors, valid JSON-LD, admin
login + all 6 tabs load real data, quiz works. Password for mfathy reset to
user-provided value 1234567 (superadmin).

Refs: manual review + delegated AgentRouter production-readiness pass
